				'AllCapsNick', T(890000000005102, "KWAME") --[[ModItemUnitDataCompositeDef JAZZ_AME_01 AllCapsNick]],
				'Bio', T(890000000005103, "A polished brass whistle still hangs from Kwame Mensah's belt, rarely blown but always ready. It outlasted years of walking an Accra neighbourhood after dark and settling doorstep quarrels after the watch fund ran dry. Kwame would rather hear the whole story than win an argument. Formal weapons practice came to him in scraps, so he is happiest when someone makes the purpose plain.") --[[ModItemUnitDataCompositeDef JAZZ_AME_01 Bio]],
