				'Bio', T(890000000005113, "The forests of Grand Chien once paid Jean-Baptiste Okoro's way, until a licensing dispute left his traps empty and his name unwelcome. He moves with a hunter's economy and dislikes anything that scatters birds before the work begins. Weathered shell cases ride in a leather pouch, keepsakes from lean seasons he survived without complaint. Crowded streets make him wary, but stillness brings out the best in him.") --[[ModItemUnitDataCompositeDef JAZZ_AME_02 Bio]],
