				'Bio', T(890000000005153, "The Winchester inherited from his grandfather is Moussa Diop's sole indulgence, polished nightly with linen worn almost transparent. Before paved roads drew younger hunters away, Senegalese game trails provided his living. Strangers find Moussa distant, but the bush brings a loose, unhurried grace to his step. He counts cartridges before leaving camp and regards a wasted shot as a failure of patience, not equipment.") --[[ModItemUnitDataCompositeDef JAZZ_AME_06 Bio]],
