				'Bio', T(890000000005163, "Every dawn Abel Getachew relaces his boots exactly as a sergeant once taught him, preserving a small ritual of unfinished service. He left an Ethiopian training ground before the drills could sand down his doubts. A demonstration stays with Abel after a single viewing, then eagerness spoils the result. His hands have not found a calm rhythm under pressure, but embarrassment only sends him back to practise.") --[[ModItemUnitDataCompositeDef JAZZ_AME_07 Bio]],
