				'Bio', T(890000000005193, "When the main roads of Grand Chien became unsafe, Emmanuel Kabongo led couriers along creek beds and forgotten footpaths. He has no taste for speeches, though frightened companions naturally match his pace. A charcoal map, softened by sweat and repeated folding, stays tucked inside his shirt. Emmanuel handles a gun like a borrowed tool, but darkness has never made him forget which fork leads home.") --[[ModItemUnitDataCompositeDef JAZZ_AME_10 Bio]],
