				'AllCapsNick', T(890000000005232, "LUCIEN") --[[ModItemUnitDataCompositeDef JAZZ_AME_14 AllCapsNick]],
				'Bio', T(890000000005233, "An expired licence lies absurdly neat inside Lucien Mbarga's knife sheath after many wet seasons. It survived the day Grand Chien rangers confiscated his poaching gun and promised a cell next time. Lucien performs no regret for company, preferring to leave before questions grow specific. Empty-handed at distance, he falls back on the craft nobody managed to seize: moving without announcing himself.") --[[ModItemUnitDataCompositeDef JAZZ_AME_14 Bio]],
