				'Bio', T(890000000005243, "A blue nub of classroom chalk follows Kofi Asante wherever a blank board might accept a question. He educated himself from books abandoned beneath desks while guarding a Ghanaian school at night. Ideas come readily, while knots, catches, and unfamiliar tools can make Kofi's hands look borrowed. Being treated as useless stings him, but he learns from a mistake before repeating it himself.") --[[ModItemUnitDataCompositeDef JAZZ_AME_15 Bio]],
