				'Bio', T(890000000005253, "One mine-struck cart was enough to shape João Domingos's years in an Angolan local watch. Loose earth slows him at once, and he refuses to disguise caution as some grand tactical instinct. A smooth iron bolt recovered from the wreck rolls between his fingers whenever a road feels wrong. Hidden danger can hold João back, but a threat he can see receives the full weight of a stubborn, unsentimental man.") --[[ModItemUnitDataCompositeDef JAZZ_AME_16 Bio]],
