				'Bio', T(890000000005273, "Questions rather than repair figures fill the grease-stained shop notebook in Serge Kouassi's pocket. He grew up above his father's Grand Chien garage, surrounded by tools he never learned to love. Practical work makes Serge's hands fumble, while contradictions in a story catch him immediately. He believes thought can open doors that muscle cannot and sometimes forgets that a good idea still needs someone to turn the handle.") --[[ModItemUnitDataCompositeDef JAZZ_AME_18 Bio]],
