				'Bio', T(890000000005283, "A dented tin lunch box has survived every fall Bongani Dlamini declines to discuss. It accompanied years of guarding a South African mining compound, carrying sacks by day and stealing sleep between alarms. Bongani rises slowly, speaks rarely, and sees no virtue in hurrying merely to impress someone. He will never be first around a corner, but once his bulk settles into a doorway, moving him becomes everybody else's problem.") --[[ModItemUnitDataCompositeDef JAZZ_AME_19 Bio]],
