				'Bio', T(890000000005303, "Pencil marks cover the inside of Omar Diallo's cartridge box, accounting for rounds that did not return. He deserted a Senegalese unit after an order treated lives as replaceable supplies. Omar keeps his distance from uniforms now and speaks only after watching a room settle. The path forward can make him hesitate, but once the rifle reaches his shoulder he wastes neither motion nor breath.") --[[ModItemUnitDataCompositeDef JAZZ_AME_21 Bio]],
