				'AllCapsNick', T(890000000005312, "BASTIEN") --[[ModItemUnitDataCompositeDef JAZZ_AME_22 AllCapsNick]],
				'Bio', T(890000000005313, "Bastien Lafontaine learned his trade with a Grand Chien militia, covering alleys where walls seemed to close in during trouble. Cheap tobacco stains his fingers, but he saves the cigarette until everything has gone quiet. A rolling paper stays folded inside the oil rag he uses on his rifle, a private promise of rest. Bastien is not imaginative under changing orders, yet in a confined street his steady bursts arrive exactly where companions expect them.") --[[ModItemUnitDataCompositeDef JAZZ_AME_22 Bio]],
