				'AllCapsNick', T(890000000005332, "MICHEL") --[[ModItemUnitDataCompositeDef JAZZ_AME_24 AllCapsNick]],
				'Bio', T(890000000005333, "Michel Kabeya once unloaded riverboats in Congo, betting his lunch on whether a dented can would land inside a distant crate. The game eventually became a practical occupation involving objects no one wanted thrown back. He is loud over drinks and utterly silent before a toss, rubbing a copper pull ring threaded onto his belt. Michel trusts his arm, but never lingers to admire the place where its delivery comes down.") --[[ModItemUnitDataCompositeDef JAZZ_AME_24 Bio]],
