				'Bio', T(890000000005363, "A cracked compass needs one sharp tap from Sekou Camara before its needle remembers north. He carried it while patrolling the Malian desert, where an upright man against a pale horizon becomes everyone's landmark. Restlessness serves Sekou in open country and irritates patient companions. He lacks reach for distant contests, but crosses exposed ground fast enough to give slower people room to breathe.") --[[ModItemUnitDataCompositeDef JAZZ_AME_27 Bio]],
