				'Bio', T(890000000005403, "A spare bootlace circles Rafael dos Santos's wrist, recalling the day a broken boot delayed an entire column. Angolan road crews rarely saw him understand a new drill before anyone else. Rather than pretend, Rafael repeated the motion until it belonged to him. Sudden changes make him rigid, but fatigue and dust do little to loosen a promise he has already made.") --[[ModItemUnitDataCompositeDef JAZZ_AME_31 Bio]],
