				'Bio', T(890000000005423, "A crushed silver-coloured cigarette case still shuts for Claude Mvemba with a satisfying click, though opening it needs a thumbnail. Grand Chien plantation work taught him to let most trouble come closer to the shotgun. Conversation bores Claude; cigarettes do not. Distant contests hold little appeal, but among sheds, fences, and cane he judges space with the ease of long habit.") --[[ModItemUnitDataCompositeDef JAZZ_AME_33 Bio]],
