				'Bio', T(890000000005483, "A dented pocket mirror lets Joseph “Hyena” Mukendi inspect a doorway without offering it his head. Grand Chien survivors remembered his ambush laugh before they remembered the face. Joseph fights with quick, practical cruelty and considers elegance a luxury for safer rooms. Nerve carries him through ugly moments, though his appetite for nearness can place him where a wiser man would never go.") --[[ModItemUnitDataCompositeDef JAZZ_AME_39 Bio]],
