				'Bio', T(890000000005503, "His mother's tiny brass thimble glints absurdly between Sipho “Anvil” Khumalo's enormous fingers while he repairs webbing. A South African gun crew gave every oversized burden to his shoulders. Sipho thinks in straight lines, advances without grace, and claims no gift for a fine shot. He adapts slowly, but once the heavy barrel settles, neither recoil nor argument moves him easily.") --[[ModItemUnitDataCompositeDef JAZZ_AME_41 Bio]],
